                        "entry_id": "5eee90b7-120f-327f-8462-70cfc2be61da",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of a geologic period within the Paleozoic era; comprises the Llandovery, Wenlock, Ludlow and Pridoli epochs from about 439 to 409 million years ago."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "968a1ebd-094e-45ff-a7df-33de35158a6b",
                                "sense_id": "2f6c2fe2-5cbe-3558-a3ae-c99bbea3dd06",
                                "text": "In some places, however, quartz reefs, payably auriferous while in Silurian rock, have been followed down to subjacent granite, and have there been found to thin out and become unprofitable […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
